@baseURL = http://localhost:3333

### Testes de API - Horários

### INSTRUÇÕES DE USO:
### 1. Execute primeiro a requisição "Login" para obter o token
### 2. O token será automaticamente usado nas outras requisições através da variável {{Login.response.body.token}}
### 3. Se o token expirar, execute o Login novamente

### AUTENTICAÇÃO (Execute primeiro para obter o token)

# @name Login
POST {{baseURL}}/session
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@admin.com",
  "senha": "123456"
}

###

# @name CriarHorario
POST {{baseURL}}/horarios
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{Login.response.body.token}}

{
  "dia_semana": "SEGUNDA",
  "horario_inicio": "07:30:00",
  "horario_fim": "08:20:00"
}

###

# @name CriarHorarioCodigo
POST {{baseURL}}/horarios/codigo
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{Login.response.body.token}}

{
  "codigo": "M1"
}

###

# @name BuscarTodosHorarios
GET {{baseURL}}/horarios
Authorization: Bearer {{Login.response.body.token}}

###

# @name BuscarHorarioPorId
GET {{baseURL}}/horarios/horario-uuid-aqui
Authorization: Bearer {{Login.response.body.token}}

###

# @name AtualizarHorario
PUT {{baseURL}}/horarios/horario-uuid-aqui
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{Login.response.body.token}}

{
  "dia_semana": "TERCA",
  "horario_inicio": "08:30:00",
  "horario_fim": "09:20:00"
}

###

# @name ExcluirHorario
DELETE {{baseURL}}/horarios/horario-uuid-aqui
Authorization: Bearer {{Login.response.body.token}}

###

# @name CriarHorarioCompleto
POST {{baseURL}}/horarios
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{Login.response.body.token}}

{
  "dia_semana": "QUARTA",
  "horario_inicio": "13:30:00",
  "horario_fim": "14:20:00"
}

###

# @name CriarHorarioTarde
POST {{baseURL}}/horarios/codigo
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{Login.response.body.token}}

{
  "codigo": "T1"
}

###

# @name CriarHorarioNoite
POST {{baseURL}}/horarios/codigo
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{Login.response.body.token}}

{
  "codigo": "N1"
}